Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:37:12 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] design(env): grama do Terrain, chao PBR, mato alto e
 chuva (lote 6)

Terrain com grama 3D animada (Decoration) 0,1 stud acima do chao de pecas,
caminhos de paralelepipedo/areia/terra, touceiras Poly Haven com VisualDetail,
tijolo e ardosia PBR, e chuva no cliente com som, respingos e relampago.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
